e_copy","SPEARHEADING RETIAL DESIGN","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Weaving together product stories and\u003C/span>\u003Cspan> brand heritage were key to expressing Barbour&rsquo;s Royal Warrant status, we made sure it was present at every detail.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>The design for every exhibition had to overcome a number of challenges with sizes, formats, locations, guidelines. The bi-annual stand designs were often the first glimpse of what evolved into Barbour&rsquo;s next retail store environments. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"_modelApiKey":135,"isReversed4060":89,"assets":136},"module_side_by_side_asym",[137,150],{"copy":31,"asset":138},{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":139},{"width":140,"height":141,"url":142,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":143},1726,2206,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738938549-barbour_s-2013-8314.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":144,"srcSet":145,"src":146,"width":147,"height":148,"sizes":149},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738938549-barbour_s-2013-8314.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2000 500w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738938549-barbour_s-2013-8314.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2000 1000w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738938549-barbour_s-2013-8314.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2000 1500w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738938549-barbour_s-2013-8314.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2000 2000w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738938549-barbour_s-2013-8314.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=2000 500w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738938549-barbour_s-2013-8314.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=2000 1000w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738938549-barbour_s-2013-8314.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=2000 1500w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738938549-barbour_s-2013-8314.jpg?fit=crop&w=2000 2000w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738938549-barbour_s-2013-8314.jpg?fit=crop&w=2000",2000,2556,"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px",{"copy":31,"asset":151},{"isVideo":9,"videoH